Third-party software, libraries, frameworks, fonts, icons, images, and other external materials are not covered by this proprietary notice. They remain subject to their respective owners' copyright and license terms. Nothing here overrides a third-party license, a right granted by applicable law, or a right that cannot lawfully be excluded.

This notice concerns protectable original expression and rights validly held; it does not claim ownership of the general idea, methods, or functionality of a collaboration or productivity product. It does not claim trademark registration or guarantee that unauthorized use can always be prevented.

